      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-04T03:50:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In the interest of generalising this answer, \"redirecting damage\" and \"dealing damage\" are distinctly different. Redirected damage still has its original source dealing that damage. Redirected damage is not buffed when redirected.</p>",
