      "created_at": "2012-12-04T16:57:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Side Question but still about Absolute Zero</p><p>1) If a card makes him invulverable to fire damage, does it still count as &nbsp;dealth damage? So he can redirect it?</p><p>2) If he is dealth 1 fire damage, and the card that reduces 1 fire damage to zero. Can he stil redirect that 0 damage to hit himself to heal 1? As Cryo Chamber means cold damge deal 1 more. Or can he deal 0+1 damage if he has Focused Apparatus?</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
